      "text": "Bought a bag of Fernhill \"Premium Seed Starter\" and honestly it's the worst compost I've ever had the misfortune to open. Half of it is unrotted twigs, the other half is dust that repels water like it's been waterproofed. My tomato seedlings sulked for three weeks in it. Save your money, absolute garbage."
